  "protocol_notes": [
    "All three new arms use experiments/run_screened_fem_locked.py --cohort synthetic50 with its defaults for material_prior_weight (0.05), contrast_ratio_lock (1.20 -> ratio locked for low-contrast predictions), eq_correlation_rollback (0.85), accept_threshold 0.05 and probe_count 2.",
    "The frozen primary was produced by lung_inverse_rendering/evaluate_sim_lung_v2.py (material_prior_weight 0.05, adaptive_search_sigma 2.0, no ratio lock, no eq_correlation_rollback). Its '7 initial probes' are 1 initial + 3 free parameters x 2 symmetric probes = probe_count 2 with an unlocked ratio; run_screened_fem_locked reproduces this with --probe-count 2 except for the contrast-locked cases (5 probes).",
    "acceptance_metric=residual re-scores the initial and final parameters on the prior-free Huber track residual and applies the 5% rule to that; the optimizer itself still minimises the MAP objective."
